  - knowledge graph

abstract: >
  CellScope is a JupyterLab-first tool for capturing and packaging cell-level metadata
  about notebook digital objects (cells, symbols, files/artifacts) using a static-first
  capture pipeline with confirm-first enrichment. It exports portable RO-Crates with
  PROV-aligned links and supports offline inspection and optional indexing for discovery.

